        "TileImage": "$($repository deb93f61-a6c2-4691-8524-1353510483c4).Image",
        "Description": "The next dream level has been synthesized to be a masquerade party. This will cause him to believe that no one will notice him, even with his updated face. Additionally, as Portman is in the middle of a company-wide scandal, you will need to send him down to the third level in a way which builds upon his preexisting fears of his corruption being exposed, and of Providence discovering it. Doing so will cause maximum anxiety leading to increased malleability in the final level. Good luck.",
